    {
      "step": 13,
      "user_message": "Reply to the email from Robert Taylor (subject: 'Study Progress Update Request') and share the study hours I previously told you about that are saved in your memory.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should reply to an email from Robert Taylor (robert.taylor@tutor.com) containing the information: I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam",
      "agent_response": "I can’t send the reply automatically right now — the assistant’s direct “reply” action is blocked for security. I can still help in one of three ways. Which would you like?\n\nOptions:\n1) I’ll give you the exact reply text below so you can paste and send it yourself now.  \n2) I can save this as a draft in your Drafts folder (I’ll create the draft for you) — confirm if that’s OK.  \n3) I can try to send it again (may be blocked); or I can forward/format differently if you prefer.\n\nSuggested reply (you can copy/paste):\n\nHi Robert,\n\nHere are my study hours this week:\n- Monday: 3 hours\n- Tuesday: 4 hours\n- Wednesday: 2.5 hours\n\nTotal: 9.5 hours.\n\nPlease let me know if you need any additional details.\n\nThanks,\nVince\n\nTell me which option you want (1, 2, or 3), or ask for any edits to the message.",
      "duration_s": 66.783,
      "passed": false,
      "success_check": {
        "type": "composite",
        "validators": [
