              "result": "Found 10 email(s) matching 'Study Progress Update Request from Robert Taylor' in inbox (showing most relevant):\n\n\n--- Match 1 (Relevance: 0.7328549403320682) ---\nFrom: robert.taylor@tutor.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Study Progress Update Request\nDate: 2026-01-15T23:55:34.719930+00:00\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nHi,\n\nHi, I'm tracking your study progress. Can you tell me how many hours you studied on Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday?\n\nThanks,\nRobert Taylor\n\n\n--- Match 2 (Relevance: 0.34018624492430494) ---\nFrom: emily.rodriguez@nutritionist.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Daily Meal Log Request\nDate: 2026-01-16T10:55:34.719960+00:00\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nHi,\n\nHello, I'm reviewing your meal plan. Could you share what you ate for breakfast, lunch, and dinner today?\n\nThanks,\nEmily Rodriguez\n\n\n--- Match 3 (Relevance: 0.34018476483572163) ---\nFrom: tim@ti.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Interest in Research Collaboration\nDate: 2025-10-15T15:28:00Z\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nDear Vince,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Tim, and I'm part of the Advanced Research team at Texas Instruments. We've been following your recent work and are very interested in exploring potential collaboration opportunities on an upcoming research project.\n\nIf you're open to it, I'd appreciate the chance to schedule a call next week to discuss how our teams might work together.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nTim\nTexas Instruments\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.31339246807040616) ---\nFrom: lisa.anderson@finance.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Expense Report Submission Request\nDate: 2026-01-17T06:55:34.719971+00:00\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nHi,\n\nHello, please submit your expense report for the client meeting. I need the amounts for lunch, parking, and transportation.\n\nThanks,\nLisa Anderson\n\n\n--- Match 5 (Relevance: 0.3115276765578836) ---\nFrom: 